      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/offers": [
      {
        "@id": "https://voir.lactualite.com/genid/7778ce501ce575a0"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/organizer": [
      {
        "@id": "https://voir.lactualite.com/genid/71c7d2b5ddd3a1c5"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://voir.lactualite.com/evenements/90-s-dance-party-d624b1"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "90’S DANCE PARTY"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Backstreet’s Back, alright! On Saturday, October 31st, SUPER TASTE takes over Ausgang Plaza for the 3rd Halloween edition of our legendary 90’S DANCE PARTY. Starting at 9:30PM, we’re summoning the spirits of the decade that gave us The Fifth Element, Hocus Pocus, The Mask and I Know What You Did Last Summer for an unforgettable night on the dancefloor. Featuring a drag tribute to the Spice Girls celebrating the group’s 30th anniversary: you really don’t want to miss this! Break out your best Britney-era (…Baby One More Time) costume, dust off your Nirvana-inspired flannel, or hop aboard the Vengabus — We Like to Party! — for a haunted journey through the greatest 90s pop, R&B, eurodance, alternative, grunge, hip-hop and pop-punk anthems. All looks are welcome, but bonus points for costumes inspired by iconic 90s pop culture moments like Clueless, Wayne’s World, Thelma and Louise or The Matrix! Expect spooky visuals, nostalgic moments and prizes for the best costumes! Let your inner witch out. Near, far, wherever you are… let’s party like it’s 1997. CODE VESTIMENTAIRE : MUSIQUE, FILMS ET TÉLÉ DES ANNÉES 90 Avec la musique de / Playing music by: BRITNEY SPEARS / THE BACKSTREET BOYS / SPICE GIRLS / MARIAH CAREY / AQUA / VANILLA ICE / TLC / BLINK-182 / CHER / DESTINY’S CHILD / ACE OF BASE / 2PAC / SHANIA TWAIN / NO DOUBT / CHRISTINA AGUILERA / DAFT PUNK / MADONNA / JANET JACKSON / GREEN DAY / CELINE DION / THE PRODIGY / BRANDY / NSYNC / ROBIN S. / WILL SMITH / JAMIROQUAI / AALIYAH / THE OFFSPRING / VENGABOYS / JENNIFER LOPEZ / BLACK BOX / EMINEM / CRYSTAL WATERS / WHITNEY HOUSTON / SMASH MOUTH / LA BOUCHE / BECK / SNOW / TECHNOTRONIC / SHAGGY / CECE PENISTON / HADDAWAY / REAL MCCOY / FATBOY SLIM / CULTURE BEAT / DEEE-LITE / DR. ALBAN / EIFFEL 65 / GILLETTE / ULTRA NATÉ / LOS DEL RÍO / CORONA / SNAP! / LEN et plus encore / and much more! **Aucun remboursement sauf si l’événement est annulé ou si il y’a changement de date.** **No refunds unless the date of the event is changed or cancelled** Veuillez noter que des photos et des vidéos seront prises pendant l'événement à des fins de marketing.En achetant un billet, vous consentez à l'utilisation des photos et des vidéos pour des activités promotionnelles. Please note that photographs and videos will be taken during the event for marketing purposes. By purchasing a ticket, you consent to the use of these media materials for promotional activities 18+ Remboursements Aucun remboursement Échanges Aucun échange Accès pour personnes à mobilité réduite Oui"
      }
    ],
