      {
        "@language": "fr-ca",
        "@value": "Le 12 septembre 2027 à 0 h, à Parc Jean-Drapeau (Montréal). The POWER UP TOUR 2026 brings AC/DC to Parc Jean-Drapeau for a single outdoor date. The show pairs a career-spanning set with the scale of Montreal’s primary festival site. Genre: Rock / Best for: High-volume outdoor shows."
      }
    ],
