        "@value": "Le 8 novembre 2026 à 0 h, à Place Bell (Beaconsfield). Alan Cavé is a Haitian-American kompa (compas) artist whose music blends Caribbean rhythms with vocals in French, Haitian Creole, and English . His November 8, 2026 Place Bell date is listed under the World music category on the Weekend Owl…"
