        "@language": "fr-ca",
        "@value": "Le 19 octobre 2026 à 19 h, à DIÈSE ONZE JAZZ CLUB & RESTAURANT (Montréal). Latin jazz concert with Alex Bellegarde on bass, Willy Baretto on piano, Nestor Rodriguez on saxophone, and Diomer Gonzales on percussion. Two shows at 7pm and 9:30pm."
      }
