    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr-ca",
        "@value": "Le 2 octobre 2026 à 0 h, à Mont-Tremblant Casino (Mont-Tremblant). Music Schedule Enjoy live music on Fridays and Saturdays, starting at 6 p.m., and on Sundays, starting at 11 a.m., at the Altitude restaurant at the Mont-Tremblant Casino. Just for Laughs Comedy Club on Tour On Thursdays, October…"
