    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr-ca",
        "@value": "Le 1er décembre 2026 à 0 h, à Lieu à préciser (Montréal) (Montréal). Delicious yule log, illuminated fir tree, Christmas stocking, Advent calendar, and greeting cards, the origins of these customs are revealed to you in the exhibition at the Château Ramezay Museum titled Around the Hearth… Holiday…"
      }
