      {
        "@language": "fr-ca",
        "@value": "Le 14 novembre 2026 à 0 h, à The Church of St. Andrew and St. Paul (Montréal). During the Festival International Bach Montréal, spend an afternoon with the family learning about Johann Sebastian Bach. Delightful anecdotes, funny moments, and deeply moving trials come to life through the music of a…"
