    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Bar Central at the Mont-Tremblant Casino | October Schedule"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Enjoy a full month of live music throughout October at the Bar Central at the Casino de Mont-Tremblant: Rythmik Nights, Fridays and Saturdays, starting at 7 p.m.: Fridays and Saturdays, starting at 7 p.m., a DJ will be performing Thanksgiving Special: Saturday, October 10: Live band and DJ starting at 7 p.m. Sunday, October 11: DJ starting at 7 p.m. Just for Laughs Comedy Club on tour On Thursdays, October 15, 22, and 29, as well as November 5, 12, and 19, Just for Laughs presents a series of comedy shows. In an atmosphere inspired by American comedy clubs, hosts Pascale Marineau and Magali Saint-Vincent will welcome several comedians to keep you laughing for 90 minutes straight. Open to those 18 and older and completely free. No reservations required; seats are assigned on a first-come, first-served basis. Halloween The Casino is transforming to celebrate Halloween with themed decorations and costumed characters. On October 30 and 31, come out for drinks, dinner, or to party at the Central Bar with a DJ starting at 7 p.m. [phone] | casinos.lotoquebec.com"
      }
    ],
