        "@value": "Le 17 juin 2027 à 0 h, à Lieu à préciser – Joliette (Joliette). Downtown Joliette will come alive with the arrival of Cirque Alphonse under its massive big top. This circus festival promises to wow audiences of all ages. Bastingue transports us to a world where raw daring, festive music, sometimes…"
