        "@value": "Beer Fair — Québec | VOIR"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr-ca",
        "@value": "Le 25 septembre 2027 à 15 h, à Parc Durocher (Québec). A celebration where everyone can find their style, the Beer Fair is taking over Parc Durocher on September 25 and 26. Just in time for Oktoberfest, brewers, local producers, restaurants, and artists will bring this hop-filled tradition to life…"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
      {
        "@language": "fr-ca",
