        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "DANCE AND MUSICALITY"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Back to basics with this workshop focusing on dance and music as the main tools of expression, as they are too often under used even if they are prime components of a Burlesque act. This workshop focuses on touching and hearing, connection to body through music to serve at its best your act story or concept! All levels and gender. Dress as you feel comfortable (no specific outfit requirement), heels are optional but not mandatory. BRING A PAIR OF GLOVES."
      }
    ],
